OL,3,GNEWSAViews sought on measures aimed at
OL,4,Adog walkers
OL,5,
OL,6,FViews are being sought on measures
OL,7,Ftaken to enforce responsible behaviour
OL,8,Fby dog walkers in Reigate and Banstead.
OL,10,FReigate & Banstead Borough Council has
OL,11,Fopened a consulation on public spaces
OL,12,Fprotection orders (PSPOs) used for dog
OL,13,Fwalkers.
OL,15,FThe dog PSPOs have been in place for
OL,16,Fsix years and was last reviewed in
OL,17,F2023.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
