OL,3,GNEWSAViews sought on measures aimed at
OL,4,Adog walkers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe consultation, which opened on 17
OL,7,FAugust, will gather feedback from those
OL,8,Fwho use the borough's public spaces and
OL,9,Fquestion whether they think the current
OL,10,Forders should be continued, changed or
OL,11,Fstopped.
